      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Set Apart, in the womb (like Orlando Bloom) | Sunday Service\n\nTo get a free audio copy of my book \u2018How to Become a Christian in 7 Days\u2019, just sign up with your email address and we\u2019ll send out a copy when it\u2019s released - forms.gle/JYcoitWnrEgnqH5W7\n\nVideo",
